{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ligo is an adventure Sokoban game, where you solve handcrafted puzzles and mysteries about the world by merging, cutting, pushing smalls creatures together and crushing squids with blocks.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462810/extras/Animation__0_.gif?t=1741111219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each part of the world has different rules and challenges. Explore an interconnected world of puzzles and mysteries. You take control of small blob-like creature and make them work together to solve many types of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462810/extras/Animation__1_.gif?t=1741111219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462810/extras/Animation__2_.gif?t=1741111219\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nonlinear puzzle game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Challenging and rewarding </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> More than 200+ handcrafted puzzles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Full of mysteries and secrets </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462810/extras/Animation__3_.gif?t=1741111219\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Autumn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2462810/ffa1a86f4f7e6bf1a5d78bfac7525190f178c1b2.jpg"},{"name":"Winter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2462810/939b768b318e6385989fb25ee8dfdc557ad88ca6.jpg"},{"name":"Spring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a